				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><strong>Evita returns to London West End</strong> for 55 performances. Evita will open on Tuersday 16 September at the Dominion Theatre. Newcomer <strong>Madalena Alberto</strong> will play <strong>Eva Peron</strong> and Marti Pellow in the Che role. Also the West End version will feature <strong>You Must Love Me</strong>, written by Tim Rice and Andrew Lloyd Webber for <strong>Madonna</strong>.</p>
<blockquote class="pixcode  pixcode--testimonial  testimonial testimonial--small-text">
    <div class="testimonial__content">
<p>With more than 20 major awards to its credit, and the Oscar winning film version starring <strong>Madonna</strong> and Antonio Banderas, <strong>Evita</strong> has become iconic.</p>
</div>

    
        
